    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy matching</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/is-subsequence/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 392</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Is Subsequence</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Match every letter of s at its earliest possible place in t: taking the first match never hurts. One pointer per string, one pass over t: O(|s| + |t|) time, O(1) space. For millions of queries, index t by letter and binary-search: O(|s| log |t|) per query.</p>\n"
